# One worker sits at a prompt of its own. No pane is open and the lead agent
# does not wait: only the page's server is there to have the run swept.
agent B.1: progress 20 "asking the system" | block

file brief.md: Target: a page | Change: your part | Constraints: none | Ownership: your file | Acceptance: the check
orch: init
orch: run new "one at a prompt"
task B "Write two" --name "part two" --check "exit 0" --brief brief.md
orch: start --ready
# The note has landed, so nothing of the agent's is on its way when this ends.
await: B.1 state working progress.pct 20
